[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12241.59, "timestamp": "03:24:01", "text": "問題是，我最初購買"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12250.07, "timestamp": "03:24:10", "text": "Workspace 是為了 Onexia，所以我的所有郵箱、賬戶等等都在 Onexia 下。我可以把自己關聯到一個子域名jocknickspace，或者我必須完全更改"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12257.51, "timestamp": "03:24:17", "text": "整個設定。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12261.03, "timestamp": "03:24:21", "text": "啊，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12264.229, "timestamp": "03:24:24", "text": "更改"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12267.349, "timestamp": "03:24:27", "text": "電子郵件地址一樣，對吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12275.03, "timestamp": "03:24:35", "text": "？ 所以這就是我猶豫要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12278.95, "timestamp": "03:24:38", "text": "不要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12281.03, "timestamp": "03:24:41", "text": "改變它的原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12285.11, "timestamp": "03:24:45", "text": "。那是我傾注心血的項目，我是創作者，所以我必須"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12290.55, "timestamp": "03:24:50", "text": "擁有自己的頁面等等，對吧？ [音樂][音樂][音樂] 等等，你知道嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12295.19, "timestamp": "03:24:55", "text": "？你能稍微處理一下，讓它聽起來更專業嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12298.63, "timestamp": "03:24:58", "text": "？ 我還不知道該如何"}]